  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5406.03 Investigations Initiated by the Division",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5406.03 Investigations Initiated by the Division. Nothing herein shall prevent the division from investigating alleged violations of RSA 376-A or these rules by transportation network companies, based on information other than formal complaints.\n\nSource. #12491, eff 4-2-18",
